   \[
   x + ky + 3(0) = 0 \implies x + ky = 0 \quad \text{(1)} \\
   x + ky - 2(0) = 0 \implies x + ky = 0 \quad \text{(2)}
   \]  
   Equations (1) and (2) are identical.  

