2. **Define \( \mu_n \) and \( \mu \) as Measures**:  
   The measures \( \mu_n \) and \( \mu \) are defined as \( \mu_n(C) = \int_C f_n \, d\mu_n \) and \( \mu(C) = \int_C f \, d\mu \), respectively.  

