\nabla \times \mathbf{V} = \left( 0 \right)\mathbf{i} + \left( -\frac{\partial \phi}{\partial x} \right)\mathbf{j} + \left( \frac{\partial \psi}{\partial x} - \frac{\partial \phi}{\partial y} \right)\mathbf{k}
\]

