\[
\phi \approx \frac{d^2}{6^2 d^2} = \frac{1}{36}
\]

Substituting these values into the Orowki equation:

\[
\sigma_{yr} = \frac{26 \times 10^9 \times 0.286 \times 10^{-9}}{10^{-8} \times (1 - \frac{1}{36})}
\]

\[
\sigma_{yr} = \frac{7.636 \times 10^3}{9.91 \times 10^{-9}}
\]

\[
\sigma_{yr} = \frac{7.636 \times 10^3}{9.91 \times 10^{-9}} = 7.69 \times 10^8 \text{ N m}^{-2} = 769 \text{ MPa}
