The equation is:
\[
\frac{\dot{H}(t)}{H^2(t)} = -\frac{1}{2} \left( \frac{\dot{\rho}(t)}{\rho(t)} + 3H(t) \left( \frac{\dot{\rho}(t)}{\rho(t)} + 3H(t) \right) \right] - \frac{3}{2} \left( \frac{\rho(t)}{\rho_{\text{total}}(t)} \right) \left( \frac{\rho(t)}{\rho_{\text{total}}(t)} + \frac{p(t)}{\rho(t)} \right]
