     \]
   - Substituting the given values:
     \[
     E = \frac{(1.0 \times 10^3 \text{ bar} - 1.0 \text{ bar}) \times 1.0 \text{ L}}{1.4 - 1}
     \]
   - Convert bar to J/L:
     \[
     1 \text{ bar} = 100 \text{ kPa} = 100 \text{ J/L}
     \]
     \[
     E = \frac{(1000 - 1) \times 100 \times 1.0}{0.4} = 2.49 \times 10^6 \text{ J}
     \]

