  - Eigenvector 3: \(\mathbf{v}_3 = \begin{bmatrix} 0.5 \\ 0.0 \\ -0.5 \end{bmatrix}\)

Thus, the orthogonal matrix \([R\) is:
\[
R = \begin{bmatrix} 0.5 & 0.5 & 0.5 \\ 0.5 & -0.5 & 0.0 \\ 0.5 & 0.0 & -0.5 \end{bmatrix}
\]

